<!-- Menu style ElDewrito (online): the CARNAGE REPORT, Halo Online's way (our own art and layout): the
header band the screen's whole width with the title and the game, SUMMARY | DETAILS as tabs (L and R),
the result, the players ranked in full-width rows - a team's band over its players, each on a slim bar in
their colour -, the hints in the foot. It stands for halo3/carnage.xml's h3/carnage/screen in the Online
style (menu_tags.c: online/ for h3/), with the same functions ("port h3 carnage ...") and children by the
same names, so the numbers, pages, scrolling, PLAYERS (Triangle) and LEAVE are those. Listed in
ingame.txt after halo3/carnage.xml and online/forge.xml (their strings, pictures and fonts). -->
